## Triggers

A change needs this review when it touches:

- [ ] Authentication, sessions, tokens
- [ ] Authorization guards, roles/capabilities, environment rules
- [ ] Data scopes ({{scope_list}}), cache keys, background jobs, exports
- [ ] Secrets, credentials, personal data
- [ ] File uploads/parsing, user-supplied URLs, redirects
- [ ] New or upgraded dependencies
- [ ] {{workspace_triggers}}

