## Revision and boundaries

- Review the exact revision from the handoff ({{revision_notation}}); read-only.
- No live exploitation of shared or production environments; evidence from existing tests, local/disposable stacks ({{local_stack}}) or traced code paths.
- No real secrets or personal data in notes or reports; findings shared only via {{disclosure_channel}}.

